<html><head><title>Your Expedition Begins!</title>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><img id="imagen" src="1_Partner_files/partnertrail01.jpg" width="90%" onerror="this.style.display='none'" style="display: none;">                                  <h1 style="font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;"><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">Your Expedition Begins!</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Welcome to the TRAIL: a guide to support teachers, students, researchers, and external partners in Transdisciplinary Education. Our goal is to foster understanding of transdisciplinary and to provide building blocks for its development and implementation.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Transdisciplinary education connects academic theory with practice, and schools with society. It brings together different perspectives to develop innovative solutions for complex problems.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Your role as a societal partner is essential in this process. Your experience and knowledge are valuable additions, serving as a bridge between the academic world and society.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Whether you are looking for fresh ideas from students, want to refresh your own knowledge, or seek ways to directly contribute to a better and sustainable society, we offer insights, challenges, and practical applications to get started.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">Let's</span><span style="margin: 0px"> begin!</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div></h1>              </body></html>